<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>We Care About You - AffinityEcho</title>
    <!--[if gte mso 9]>
    <xml>
        <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
            <o:AllowPNG/>
            <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
        </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
    </xml>
    <![endif]-->
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f3f4f6;" bgcolor="#f3f4f6">
    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f3f4f6;" bgcolor="#f3f4f6">
    <tr><td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0;">
    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);" bgcolor="#ffffff">
        <!-- Header — softer blue accent, not purple -->
        <tr><td>
            <!--[if mso]>
            <v:rect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" fill="true" stroke="false" style="width:600px;">
            <v:fill type="gradient" color="#3b82f6" color2="#0ea5e9" angle="135"/>
            <v:textbox style="mso-fit-shape-to-text:true" inset="0,0,0,0">
            <![endif]-->
            <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #0ea5e9 50%, #06b6d4 100%); background-color: #3b82f6; padding: 40px; text-align: center; color: white;">
                <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: white;">We Care About You</h1>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 16px; color: white;">You are not alone</p>
            </div>
            <!--[if mso]></v:textbox></v:rect><![endif]-->
        </td></tr>

        <!-- Body -->
        <tr><td style="padding: 40px;">
            <p style="color: #4b5563;">Hello <strong style="color: #3b82f6;"><%= username %></strong>,</p>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;">We noticed that you may be going through a difficult time. We want you to know that your well-being matters to us and to the AffinityEcho community.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4b5563;">If you or someone you know is struggling, please reach out to one of these free, confidential resources:</p>

            <!-- Resources -->
            <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin: 25px 0;">
            <tr><td style="background-color: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;" bgcolor="#eff6ff">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 15px; color: #1e40af; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px;">Crisis Resources</p>

                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1e3a5f;">
                    <strong>988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</strong><br>
                    Call or text <strong>988</strong> (available 24/7)
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1e3a5f;">
                    <strong>Crisis Text Line</strong><br>
                    Text <strong>HOME</strong> to <strong>741741</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1e3a5f;">
                    <strong>National Alliance on Mental Illness (NAMI)</strong><br>
                    Call <strong>1-800-950-NAMI (6264)</strong>
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #1e3a5f;">
                    <strong>International Association for Suicide Prevention</strong><br>
                    <a href="https://www.iasp.info/resources/Crisis_Centres/" style="color: #3b82f6;">Find a crisis center near you</a>
                </p>
            </td></tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Encouragement -->
            <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin: 25px 0;">
            <tr><td style="background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;" bgcolor="#f0fdf4">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #166534;">Your experiences and feelings are valid. Reaching out for support is a sign of strength, not weakness. The professionals at these organizations are trained to help and are available whenever you need them.</p>
            </td></tr>
            </table>

            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af;">This message was sent because we care about our community members. Your content has not been removed or hidden.</p>
        </td></tr>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <tr><td style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;" bgcolor="#f9fafb">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 14px;">You're receiving this because we want to make sure you have access to support resources.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">Need help? Contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #4f46e5;"><%= supportEmail %></a></p>
            <p style="margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">&copy; 2025 AffinityEcho. Building stronger professionals together.</p>
        </td></tr>
    </table>
    </td></tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
